# Movie Search App

## Live Demo

👉 [View Live App](https://react-movie-search-app-aligk97s-projects.vercel.app/)

![App Preview](./public/screenshot.png)

A simple movie search application built with React. Users can search for movies and view detailed information in a modal.

## Features
- Search movies by title
- View movie list
- Open movie details in a modal
- Responsive design

## Technologies
- React
- Vite
- CSS
- OMDb API

## Installation
```bash
npm install
npm run dev